    "detailed_description": "Vs Dev is an evolving game where the goal is to defeat the developer.<br />\r\nThe game has no tutorial, no story, and no set path; you must figure things out and learn on your own.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore locations, search for objects crucial to your progress and solve mini-games along the way. Every nook and cranny may hold the key to your survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress, feel the evolution of the gameplay that propels you from a horrific survival to a frantic action experience. The weapons you collect become your allies in this fight for survival, ruthlessly eliminating any enemies in your path. Mini-games and puzzles add a layer of complexity, testing not only your skill, but also your intellect.",
